DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260812T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260812T200000
SUMMARY:Game Night at Lindenwood Park Place (Tavern)
LOCATION:Lindenwood Park Place\, 3460 Jamieson Ave\, St. Louis
DESCRIPTION:Not sure if you can come? Just say yes\, I live literally fiv
 e minutes away so if you have to bail it's fine! Not sure when you can b
 e there? It doesn't matter\, we'll start a new game when you join us. No
 t sure if you want to play whatever game it is you don't want to play? W
 e won't play it! Seriously\, this is the lowest possible degree of commi
 tment possible. It's free!
